WEBVTT

00:01:57.934 --> 00:02:01.450
to build our office on top of the Pompidou Center in Paris

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:02.685
by ourselves.

00:02:02.685 --> 00:02:06.014
So we brought the paper tubes and the wooden joints

00:02:06.014 --> 00:02:10.099
to complete the 35-meter-long office.

00:02:10.099 --> 00:02:13.133
We stayed there for six years without paying any rent.

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:17.004
(Laughter) (Applause)

00:02:17.004 --> 00:02:19.391
Thank you. I had one big problem.

00:02:19.391 --> 00:02:21.745
Because we were part of the exhibition,

00:02:21.745 --> 00:02:25.049
even if my friend wanted to see me, they had to buy a ticket to see me.

00:02:25.049 --> 00:02:27.252
That was the problem.

00:02:27.252 --> 00:02:30.020
Then I completed the Pompidou Center in Metz.